</spec>
</test2>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Voltage Inspection</ptxt>
<test2>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage between the ANT terminal of the antenna cord sub-assembly connector and body ground.</ptxt>
<spec>
